Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Caixa-forta nou: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault xifra: message clau: key.
>> decrypted := vault desxifra: encrypted clau: key.

Sortida 
escriu: ['Message:'], salt-de-línia
escriu: message, salt-de-línia
escriu: ['Decrypted:'], salt-de-línia
escriu: decrypted, salt-de-línia.
